{"id": "86108", "name": "חוקי חזקות – חזקה של חזקה במספרים, מציאת המעריך (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>\\({\\left( {{CT:0}}^{{CT:1}} \\right)}^{{CT:2}}\\) can be expressed in the form: <br /> \\[{{CT:0}}^x.\\] Find the value of \\(x\\). <br /> <br /> \\(x\\) = [[input:ans]] [[validation:ans]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>Remember the rule that \\(\\left( c^a \\right)^b=c^{ab}\\). In this example \\(\\left({{CT:0}}^{{CT:1}} \\right)^{{CT:2}}\\) = \\({{CT:0}}^{{{CT:1}}\\cdot{{CT:2}}}\\). Therefore: \\[x = {{CT:1}} \\cdot {{CT:2}} = {{CT:3}}.\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "c", "ta"], "nvariants": 18}